# BOSC Xiangshan Kunminghu FPGA Prototype (xiangshan-kunminghu)

XiangShan is an open-source high-performance RISC-V processor project. The third generation Kunminghu is a 64-bit RV64GCBSUHV processor core.

https://github.com/OpenXiangShan/XiangShan

## Supported Devices

- Up to 16 xiangshan-kunminghu cores
- CLINT, IMSIC, APLIC
- 1 UART

## Running

```bash
qemu-system-riscv64 -machine xiangshan-kunminghu \
   -smp 16 -m 16G \
   -bios path/to/opensbi/platform/generic/firmware/fw_payload.bin \
   -nographic
```
