# Stellaris boards (`lm3s6965evb`, `lm3s811evb`)

## LM3S811EVB

The Luminary Micro Stellaris LM3S811EVB emulation includes:

- Cortex-M3 CPU core
- 64k Flash and 8k SRAM
- Timers, UARTs, ADC and I2C interface
- OSRAM Pictiva 96x16 OLED with SSD0303 controller on I2C bus

## LM3S6965EVB

The Luminary Micro Stellaris LM3S6965EVB emulation includes:

- Cortex-M3 CPU core
- 256k Flash and 64k SRAM
- Timers, UARTs, ADC, I2C and SSI interfaces
- OSRAM Pictiva 128x64 OLED with SSD0323 controller connected via SSI
