# STMicroelectronics STM32 boards

The [STM32](https://www.st.com/en/microcontrollers-microprocessors/stm32-32-bit-arm-cortex-mcus.html) chips are a family of 32-bit Arm-based microcontrollers by STMicroelectronics.

## Supported boards

- `stm32vldiscovery` - STM32VLDISCOVERY board with STM32F100RBT6 (Cortex-M3)
- `netduino2` - Netduino 2 board with STM32F205RFT6 (Cortex-M3)
- `netduinoplus2` - Netduino Plus 2 board with STM32F405RGT6 (Cortex-M4F)
- `olimex-stm32-h405` - Olimex STM32 H405 board with STM32F405RGT6 (Cortex-M4F)

## Supported devices

- Arm Cortex-M3, Cortex-M4F
- Analog to Digital Converter (ADC)
- EXTI interrupt
- Serial ports (USART)
- SPI controller
- System configuration (SYSCFG)
- Timer controller (TIMER)
- Reset and Clock Controller (RCC) (STM32F4 only)

## Missing devices

- Camera interface (DCMI)
- Controller Area Network (CAN)
- CRC calculation unit
- DAC
- DMA controller
- Ethernet controller
- Flash Interface Unit
- GPIO controller
- I2C controller
- I2S controller
- Power supply configuration (PWR)
- RNG
- RTC controller
- SDIO interface
- USB OTG
- Watchdog controller

## Boot options

```bash
$ qemu-system-arm -M stm32vldiscovery -kernel firmware.bin
```
