# AVR System Emulator

Use `qemu-system-avr` to emulate AVR 8-bit machines. Supports cores: avr1 through avr6, avrtiny, xmega2-xmega7.

Supports Arduino boards for educational purposes using ATmega controller with USART and 16-bit timer devices.

## Usage Examples

```bash
# Basic execution
qemu-system-avr -machine mega2560 -bios demo.elf

# With serial output via telnet
qemu-system-avr -M mega2560 -bios demo.elf -nographic \
                -serial tcp::5678,server=on,wait=off

# GDB debugging
qemu-system-avr -machine mega2560 -bios demo.elf -s -S
```
