# LoongArch System Emulator

QEMU can emulate LoongArch 64-bit systems via `qemu-system-loongarch64`. Only one machine type `virt` is supported.

With KVM, QEMU can emulate the la464 CPU model. With TCG, it emulates a subset of la464 features sufficient to run distributions built for la464.
