# QEMU Guest Agent QAPI Reference

> Source: `docs/interop/qemu-ga-ref.rst`

## Overview

This is an auto-generated reference document. The actual content is generated from the QAPI schema file at `qga/qapi-schema.json` during the QEMU build process.

The QAPI schema defines the JSON-based protocol for the QEMU Guest Agent, including all guest agent commands, parameters, return types, error definitions, and event definitions.

## Schema Location

