# MIPS System Emulator

QEMU MIPS system emulator supporting multiple boards and processor configurations.

## Supported Machines

### Malta

- MIPS Malta board (default)
- Supports MIPS32 and MIPS64 processors
- Malta FPGA for interrupt routing and device control
- PIIX4 southbridge with IDE, USB, and PCI

### Pica61

- Acer Pica 61 board
- MIPS Magnum R4000-based

### Magnum

- MIPS Magnum workstation
- R4000/R4400 processors

### Boston

- MIPS Boston board
- Supports Loongson and other MIPS64 processors

### Fuloong

- Fuloong 2E mini-PC
- Loongson 2E processor

## nanoMIPS Support

QEMU supports nanoMIPS instruction set for compact code generation.

## Usage

```
qemu-system-mips -machine malta -kernel vmlinux
qemu-system-mips64 -machine boston -kernel vmlinux
```
