# OpenRISC System Emulator

QEMU OpenRISC system emulator.

## Supported Machines

### or1k-sim

- OpenRISC 1000 simulator
- or1200 CPU core
- Basic peripheral set (UART, timer)

### or1k-virt

- Generic OpenRISC virtual platform
- VirtIO devices for network, block, and console
- Recommended for most use cases

## Supported Processors

- **or1200**: OpenRISC 1200 compatible CPU

## Usage

```
qemu-system-or1k -machine or1k-virt -kernel image.elf
```
