# Boundary Devices SABRE Lite (`sabrelite`)

Boundary Devices SABRE Lite i.MX6 Development Board featuring the Freescale/NXP i.MX 6 Quad Applications Processor.

## Supported devices

- Up to 4 Cortex-A9 cores
- Generic Interrupt Controller
- 1 Clock Controller Module, 1 System Reset Controller
- 5 UARTs, 2 EPIC timers, 1 GPT timer
- 2 Watchdog timers, 1 FEC Ethernet controller
- 3 I2C controllers, 7 GPIO controllers
- 4 SDHC storage controllers, 4 USB 2.0 host controllers
- 5 ECSPI controllers, 1 SST 25VF016B flash

## Running Linux kernel

```bash
$ export ARCH=arm
$ export CROSS_COMPILE=arm-linux-gnueabihf-
$ make imx_v6_v7_defconfig
$ make
$ qemu-system-arm -M sabrelite -smp 4 -m 1G \
    -display none -serial null -serial stdio \
    -kernel arch/arm/boot/zImage \
    -dtb arch/arm/boot/dts/imx6q-sabrelite.dtb \
    -initrd /path/to/rootfs.ext4 \
    -append "root=/dev/ram"
```

## Running U-Boot

```bash
$ make mx6qsabrelite_defconfig
$ qemu-system-arm -M sabrelite -smp 4 -m 1G \
    -display none -serial null -serial stdio \
    -kernel u-boot
```
