# Raspberry Pi boards

## Supported models

- `raspi0` / `raspi1ap` - ARM1176JZF-S core, 512 MiB RAM
- `raspi2b` - Cortex-A7 (4 cores), 1 GiB RAM
- `raspi3ap` - Cortex-A53 (4 cores), 512 MiB RAM
- `raspi3b` - Cortex-A53 (4 cores), 1 GiB RAM
- `raspi4b` - Cortex-A72 (4 cores), 2 GiB RAM

## Implemented devices

- ARM1176JZF-S, Cortex-A7, Cortex-A53 or Cortex-A72 CPU
- Interrupt controller, DMA controller
- Clock and reset controller (CPRMAN)
- System Timer, GPIO controller
- Serial ports (BCM2835 AUX and PL011)
- Random Number Generator (RNG)
- Frame Buffer, USB host (USBH)
- SD/MMC host controller, SoC thermal sensor
- USB2 host controller (DWC2 and MPHI)
- MailBox controller (MBOX)
- VideoCore firmware (property)
- Peripheral SPI controller
- Broadcom Serial Controller (I2C)

## Missing devices

- Pulse Width Modulation (PWM)
- PCIE Root Port (raspi4b)
- GENET Ethernet Controller (raspi4b)
