source: tools/index.rst
---

# QEMU Tools

QEMU includes several command-line utilities for managing virtual machines, disk images, and related resources.

## Available Tools

| Tool | Description |
|---|---|
| [qemu-img](qemu-img.md) | Disk image creation, conversion, and management |
| [qemu-nbd](qemu-nbd.md) | Network Block Device server |
| [qemu-pr-helper](qemu-pr-helper.md) | Persistent reservation helper daemon |
| [qemu-storage-daemon](qemu-storage-daemon.md) | Storage daemon with QMP control |
| [qemu-trace-stap](qemu-trace-stap.md) | SystemTap trace tool |
| [qemu-vmsr-helper](qemu-vmsr-helper.md) | Virtual RAPL MSR helper |
| [qemu-vnc](qemu-vnc.md) | Standalone VNC server via D-Bus |

## Common Tasks

### Creating a Disk Image

```bash
qemu-img create -f qcow2 disk.qcow2 10G
```

### Converting Image Formats

```bash
qemu-img convert -O qcow2 disk.raw disk.qcow2
```

### Checking Image Integrity

```bash
qemu-img check disk.qcow2
```

### Serving Images over NBD

```bash
qemu-nbd --image=disk.qcow2 --port=10809
```
